{"config":{"lang":["en"],"separator":"[\\s\\-]+","pipeline":["stopWordFilter"],"fields":{"title":{"boost":1000.0},"text":{"boost":1.0},"tags":{"boost":1000000.0}}},"docs":[{"location":"","title":"Home","text":""},{"location":"#welcome-to-my-personal-docs","title":"Welcome to My Personal Docs","text":""},{"location":"Computer%20Vision/Color/","title":"Color","text":""},{"location":"Computer%20Vision/Color/#bgr-to-rgb","title":"BGR to RGB","text":"<pre><code>rgb = cv.cvtColor(img, cv.COLOR_BGR2RGB)\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Computer%20Vision/Color/#rgb-to-grayscale","title":"RGB to Grayscale","text":"<pre><code>gray = cv.cvtColor(img, cv.COLOR_RGB2GRAY)\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Computer%20Vision/Color/#grayscale-to-binary","title":"Grayscale to Binary","text":"<pre><code>_, binary = cv.threshold(gray, 127, 255, cv.THRESH_BINARY)\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Computer%20Vision/Images/","title":"Images","text":""},{"location":"Computer%20Vision/Images/#read-image","title":"Read Image","text":"<pre><code>img = cv.imread(\"cat.jpg\")\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Computer%20Vision/Images/#show-image","title":"Show Image","text":"<p>Membuat user define function <code>showImage()</code> </p> <pre><code>def showImage(img, width=5, height=5):\n    if img is None:\n        print(\"Gambar tidak ditemukan.\")\n    else:\n        img_rgb = cv.cvtColor(img, cv.COLOR_BGR2RGB)\n\n        plt.figure(figsize=(width, height))\n        plt.imshow(img_rgb)\n        plt.axis(\"off\")\n        plt.show()\n</code></pre> <p>Memanggil function <code>showImage()</code> untuk menampilkan gambar</p> <pre><code>showImage(img)\n</code></pre> <p></p>"},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Data%20Cleaning/","title":"Data Cleaning","text":""},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Data%20Cleaning/#remove-empty-cells","title":"Remove Empty Cells","text":"<pre><code>df = df.dropna()\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Data%20Cleaning/#remove-duplicates","title":"Remove Duplicates","text":"<pre><code>df = df.drop_duplicates()\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Data%20Info/","title":"Data Info","text":""},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Data%20Info/#data-info","title":"Data Info","text":"<pre><code>df.info()\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Data%20Info/#head","title":"Head","text":"<pre><code>df.head()\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Data%20Info/#tail","title":"Tail","text":"<pre><code>df.tail()\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Load%20File/","title":"Load File","text":""},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Load%20File/#load-csv","title":"Load CSV","text":"<pre><code>df = pd.read_csv(\"data.csv\")\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Load%20File/#load-json","title":"Load JSON","text":"<pre><code>df = pd.read_json(\"data.json\")\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Mean%2C%20Median%20%26%20Mode/","title":"Mean, Median & Mode","text":""},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Mean%2C%20Median%20%26%20Mode/#mean","title":"Mean","text":""},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Mean%2C%20Median%20%26%20Mode/#median","title":"Median","text":""},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Mean%2C%20Median%20%26%20Mode/#mode","title":"Mode","text":""},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Rename%20Column/","title":"Rename Column","text":""},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Rename%20Column/#rename-column","title":"Rename Column","text":"<pre><code>df = df.rename(columns={\n    \"A\": \"col_a\",\n    \"B\": \"col_b\"\n})\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Rename%20Column/#add-column","title":"Add Column","text":"<pre><code>df[\"new_col\"] = np.nan\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Rename%20Column/#drop-column","title":"Drop Column","text":"<pre><code>df = df.drop(\"A\", axis=1)\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Sorting%20Data/","title":"Sorting Data","text":""},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Sorting%20Data/#by-column-ascending","title":"by Column (Ascending)","text":""},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Sorting%20Data/#by-column-descending","title":"by Column (Descending)","text":""},{"location":"Python/Library%20Setup/","title":"Library Setup","text":""},{"location":"Python/Library%20Setup/#installing-library","title":"Installing Library","text":"<pre><code>pip install pandas\npip install numpy\npip install matplotlib\npip install seaborn\npip install opencv-python\npip install streamlit\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Python/Library%20Setup/#importing-library","title":"Importing Library","text":"<pre><code>import pandas as pd\nimport numpy as np\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport seaborn as sns\nimport math\nimport statistics\nimport cv2 as cv\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Python/Virtual%20Env/","title":"Virtual Env","text":""},{"location":"Python/Virtual%20Env/#create-virtual-env","title":"Create Virtual Env","text":"<pre><code>python -m venv venv\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Python/Virtual%20Env/#activate-virtual-env","title":"Activate Virtual Env","text":"<pre><code>source venv/Scripts/activate\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Python/Virtual%20Env/#deactivate-virtual-env","title":"Deactivate Virtual Env","text":"<pre><code>deactivate\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Python/Virtual%20Env/#selecting-interpreter","title":"Selecting Interpreter","text":"<p>Setelah melakukan instalasi untuk virtual env, harus memilih interpreter dari venv agar seluruh kode berjalan dengan lancar</p> <p></p>"}]}